#: src/main.rs:20 src/ui/window.rs:43 src/ui/window.rs:615
msgid "MomentStays"
msgstr "留刻"

#: src/model/claims.rs:13
msgid "Android Motion Photos become Apple Live Photos. Supported static HDR photos are exported as stills."
msgstr "Android 動態照片轉換為 Apple 原況照片。受支援的靜態 HDR 照片匯出為靜態圖片。"

#: src/model/claims.rs:16
msgid "Apple Live Photos become Motion Photos for the chosen Android brand. JPEG for every brand; HEIC for Samsung only. Bursts are not converted in this direction."
msgstr "Apple 原況照片轉換為所選 Android 品牌的動態照片。所有品牌支援 JPEG；HEIC 僅限三星。此方向不轉換連拍。"

#: src/model/claims.rs:19
msgid "Bursts (experimental): Android → Apple only, JPEG only. Google, Samsung and known Huawei/Honor burst formats."
msgstr "連拍（實驗性）：僅 Android → Apple，僅 JPEG。支援 Google、三星及已知的華為/榮耀連拍格式。"

#: src/model/claims.rs:22
msgid "Try Converting Private HDR"
msgstr "嘗試轉換私有 HDR（實驗性）"

#: src/model/claims.rs:23
msgid "Experimental and off by default. Only supported configurations are tried; results are limited and the original display effect is not guaranteed. Standard HDR is handled as usual."
msgstr "實驗功能，預設關閉。僅嘗試已支援的配置，效果有侷限，不保證原廠顯示效果。標準 HDR 依原規則處理。"

#: src/model/claims.rs:27
msgid "Source files are only read. Results are written to the output folder; keep a backup of your originals."
msgstr "來源檔案保持唯讀，結果寫入輸出資料夾；建議保留原圖備份。"

#: src/model/claims.rs:28
msgid "This build has no Linux codec backend: static HDR checks, burst checks and image re-encoding are unavailable."
msgstr "此版本未包含 Linux 編解碼後端：無法進行靜態 HDR 檢查、連拍檢查和影像重新編碼。"

